    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ROME\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "ROME\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nROME, the Eternal City, is rich in artistic treasures. 2500 years of history lives on in the glorious\nmonuments, churches and ruins. The Roman Forum, the Colosseum, the Vatican, St. Peter's, the\nSistine Chapel, the Pantheon, the Spanish Steps, Trevi Fountain are just a few. History is Rome's forte\nbut the shops, food, wine, and the friendly people are renowned throughout the world. Pan Am\nserves Rome every day directly from New York and Los Angeles\nPAN AM.\n2003.016.005",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum\nPremium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nHors d'Oeuvre Gastronomiques\nSelected gourmet delicacies\nRôti au Vo\nSelected cut of aged beef, lamb or other succulent meat\nroasted on board and carved to order\nYour flight attendant will advise you of today's roast\nVeau au Morilles\nTender veal with Morilles mushrooms in a sauce of Cognac and heavy cream.\nSuprême de Volaille Diable\nBoneless breast of chicken with an exotic stuffing and a tangy sauce\nDarne de Saumon au Champagne\nDelicate Salmon steak poached in Champagne\nPlat du Jour\nSpecialty of the day\nmmoe do Terre Maison\nNOT ON MENU\nTURBOT\nPLATE DU TOOR\nNOTON THE\nPLANE\nHE CHIX ON",
      "Suprême de Volaille Diable\nBoneless breast of chicken with an exotic stuffing and a tangy sauce\nCafé\nCoffee\nDarne de Saumon au Champagne\nDelicate Salmon steak poached in Champagne\nPlat du Jour\nSpecialty of the day\nPommes de Terre Maison\nPotatoes Maison\nRiz Pilaf\nRice Pilaf\nLégumes au Beurre\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nSalade Campagnarde\nTossed garden salad\nSélection de Fruits et Fromages\nSelected fruits and cheeses\nDessert\nThé\nTea\nNOT ON THE\nPLANE\nHE CHIX\nMENU /S\nDUCK\nCafé Décaféiné\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nDrambuie\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nAmaretto di Saronno Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nCointreau\n448K090"
    ],
